  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-256-288"><seg source="#source-256-288">星のけむりの下にして</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-288-317"><seg source="#source-288-317">石組黒くひそめるを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-317-355"><seg source="#source-317-355">さもあしざまに鳴き棄てつ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-355-398"><seg source="#source-355-398">くわくこう一羽北に過ぎたり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-398-433"><seg source="#source-398-433">夜のもみぢの木もそびえ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-433-465"><seg source="#source-433-465">御堂の屋根も沈めるを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-465-497"><seg source="#source-465-497">さらに一羽の鳥ありて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-497-551"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497-530"><rb>寒天質</rb><rt>アガーチナス</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-530-551">の闇に溶けたり</seg></p>
    </body>
